# Lab 01: Configure Initial Switch Settings

## Overview
This lab covers the initial configuration and security of Cisco switches using Packet Tracer.

## Objectives
- Configure switch hostnames.
- Secure console access.
- Configure enable passwords and enable secret.
- Encrypt plaintext passwords.
- Configure MOTD banners.
- Save configurations to NVRAM.

## Devices
- Cisco Catalyst 2960 Switch S1
- Cisco Catalyst 2960 Switch S2

## Verification Commands
- show running-config
- show startup-config

## Skills Learned
- Cisco IOS CLI
- Basic switch configuration
- Password security
- Configuration management

## Tool
Cisco Packet Tracer
